    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banhū kūnomba Yelemia abalombele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale nū Yohanani ū ng'wana Kalea, na Yezania ng'wana Hoshaya, na a banhū a bangī pye bado na bataale, būng'wegeela ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū ng'hangi Yelemia būng'wīla, “Tūdegelekage baba ū kūlīla kwise, ūnombe ū SEEBA Mulungu wako, ūlīlombele ī libità pyī īlo lyashiigīīlile lyenīlī. Nguno nū bebe ūlībona na miso gako, gīkī nūūlū īkī twalī bingī ī kale, alīyo ī haha twasaagile bagehu no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nombage ū SEEBA Mulungu wako atoolekeje ī lipandī ī lya kūja; nī yīyo ītwigelile kwīyīta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hangi Yelemia ūbashokeja, “Nang'wigwaga ū nene nakūmulombela ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we gīt'ūmo mulīlombela, na būlī mhayo ūyo ūgūhaya ū SEEBA nakūmuwīla; natūmubisa mhayo gose gose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būng'wīla ū Yelemia, “Ūlū tūleka ū kwīta ūmo īlī pyī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alakūtūme kwiza kūtūwīla, ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ū nkaanīji wise wa ng'hana na nsanyiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise nūūlū gūtūbeelele, nūūlū gūtūbipīle ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wise ūyo tūlīkūtūma kūja kūlī we, nahene tūkūng'wigwa dūhū; ū mu gīko ī mihayo yise īkūgololoka; nguno a bise shiigelile tūng'wigwe ū SEEBA Mulungu wise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ishosho lya ng'wa SEEBA kū banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jabīta shikū ikūmi ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gwiza ū kūlī Yelemia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'witana ū Yohanani ng'wana Kalea, na a bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale abo baalī hamò nang'hwe; na a banhū pye a bose, bado na bataale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, ūyo ng'walī ng'wanitūmile kūntwalīla kūlomba kwing'we, alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ūlū ng'wikala ū mu sī yenīyī, ū nene nakūmuzenga, natūmukambagūla; nakūmuhamba, natūmudubbūla; nguno naapīnīhalile no kūlwa mayanga ayo naamugwisīgije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutang'ogohage ū ntemi wa Babuloni, ūyo alīng'ogohya ī haha. Lekagi ū kūng'ogoha.’ Alīhaya SEEBA. ‘Nguno nalī hamò ning'we, nakūmupīja nang'wīnje ū mu nkono gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmuchīla shigongo, nū wei nakūng'wīta amuchīle shigongo a bing'we, amushoshe hangī ū mu sī ying'we.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ng'ūhaya gīkī, “A bise tūtikalaga ū mu sī īyī, hūna muleke ū kūng'wigwa ū SEEBA Mulungu win'gwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūlū ng'ūhaya, ‘Yaya shi ī gīko, a bise tūkūja tūkikale Misili, ūko tūtūbona būlūgū nūūlū kwigwa ilaka lya nhaaninga ja būlūgū, nūūlū tūtūūkoyiwa nzala kūlwa kūgayiwa shilīwa,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we būshiigo wa banhū ba Yuda, ūlū mulīīta gīko gwigwagi lūūlū ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA; ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ūlū mubize ng'hana mumalīīlile kūja Misili kūjiikala ko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "managi gīkī ī līlūshū īlo mulīīlīpeela līkūmupandīka koi, nī nzala īyo yamupambūlile ū kūnū īkūmulondeja ko ī Misili; mukūja mukashile kūcha koi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo pye abo bagaabīlile kūja Misili, kūjiikala kwenūko bakūshila kūcha kūlwa līlūshū, nzala na mahūūya; atilonga nūūlū ūmò ū wa kūpīla nūūlū kūbūpūlūgūka ū būkenaagūji ūbo nakūbenhela.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ūmo būpelanu na būkalī bone būkabidīkīla abo bikalaga mu Yelusalemu, na a bing'we ūlū mulaaje Misili būkūng'wihoolekela gīko ū būpelanu wane. Mukūbiza shikolo sh'izumo, igekemaja, banhū ba kūyilembekejiwa mihayo, na kwibengelejiwa; ī lipandī lyenīlī mutalalībona hangī.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee bing'we būshiigo wa Yuda, ū SEEBA wamuwīlile gīkī, ‘Mutizūja ī Misili.’ Alilūūlū deebelagi, ī lelo yenīyī nalīmuhūgūla ū nene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī, ng'walī ng'wahūbile ū kūnitūma ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, mulīniwīla, ‘Tūlombelage ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wise; ūlatūwīle pyī īyo alayīhaye, nise tūkwīyīta.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lelo yenīyī namuwīla, alīyo mutūng'wigwaga ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, ū mu yose īyo wanilagīlile kūmumanīkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ī haha managi gīkī mukūmalwa līlūshū na nzala, na mahūūya, ū kwipandī īlo mulītogwa kūja kwikala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
